it. So this tailor expansion so we're gonna

00:31:27.741 --> 00:31:29.620
need to tailor expand a third order in the loss.

00:31:30.581 --> 00:31:32.581
So this Taylor expansion reveals

00:31:32.721 --> 00:31:34.690
the crucial ingredient that's missing

00:31:35.331 --> 00:31:36.951
from current optimization theory.

00:31:37.561 --> 00:31:39.801
Without this ingredient, you can't understand the behavior

