00:31:42.096 --> 00:31:42.740
you can.

00:31:44.601 --> 00:31:46.871
The key fact is that oscillations

00:31:46.871 --> 00:31:48.751
along the top eigenvector of the Hessian

00:31:49.151 --> 00:31:50.691
automatically induce reduction

00:31:51.331 --> 00:31:52.691
the top eigenvalue of the Hessian.

00:31:53.571 --> 00:31:55.650
So let's let me sketch that informally. You

